actually have people design things in the FMRI scanner, as the person is really kind of coming up with a room design and the parts of the brain that are involved in that. But even though oceans techniques are really high tech, his research has its roots in these iPAR studies. He thinks that they were really significant. One of the major contributions that they made was to actually show that personality is a viable topic to study if you want to understand creativity. And if nothing else, the lasting legacy of these
实际上让人在fMRI扫描仪中设计东西，当人真正想出一个房间设计时，大脑中涉及的部分就会被观察到。但尽管奥申的技术非常高科技，他的研究根源于这些iPAR研究。他认为它们确实非常重要。他们做出的主要贡献之一是证明了如果你想了解创造力，人格是一个可行的研究课题。如果说还有什么的话，这些iPAR研究的持久遗产，

